<?tyhpdef
/**
 * LAYER 3 (hand overlay) — Tyhp-authored. Never regenerated.
 * Path: `_tyhpdef/overlays/*.tyhpdef` (not under overlays/stubs/).
 * Prefixed Rector PHAR copies are unowned.
 * Types this package extends cannot be extern (TYHP3026/3027) — hollow parents.
 * PhpParser types come from tyhpdef/nikic-php-parser; PHPDoc AST from
 * tyhpdef/phpstan-phpdoc-parser. PHPStan analyser types that tyhpdef/phpstan-phpstan
 * already declares are not redeclared here.
 * Layer 1 from src/ omits some @internal types and rule-package types that
 * public signatures still name — hollow classes below.
 */

